WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.740
There's a dent in the door.
Can you repair it?

2
00:00:04.980 --> 00:00:07.800
Hello, I'm Clara, the bodywork technician.

3
00:00:08.020 --> 00:00:10.640
I'll repair the dent,
and I'll paint the door.

4
00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:12.560
Will the colour match?

5
00:00:13.440 --> 00:00:18.160
Yes. I check the colour code,
then I paint, and I polish the door.

6
00:00:18.220 --> 00:00:19.680
It will look like new.
